{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "13556536",
      "title": "Finishing Touches",
      "sourceHash": "044f6f20e17500c605c707bc3d0a412259429a745ee6d06a250b4fbbea15dc2a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.78,
          "end": 2.94,
          "en": "So here in the checkout component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.94,
          "end": 6.63,
          "en": "I also wanna use my custom useHttp hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.63,
          "end": 10.32,
          "en": "but it should be used slightly differently here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.32,
          "end": 13.26,
          "en": "We don't wanna send a request right away here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.26,
          "end": 16.083,
          "en": "but instead only after the form has been submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.19,
          "end": 20.7,
          "en": "But thankfully, we built this custom hook such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.7,
          "end": 23.61,
          "en": "that we can use it for this purpose.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.61,
          "end": 28.183,
          "en": "In the checkout component, we can use useHttp,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.18,
          "end": 32.89,
          "en": "so our custom hook here, after importing it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.62,
          "end": 36.87,
          "en": "and then also set up the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.87,
          "end": 39.693,
          "en": "to which the request eventually will be sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.77,
          "end": 43.563,
          "en": "localhost:3000/orders.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.73,
          "end": 48.24,
          "en": "Now as a next step, we should pass the config object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 48.24,
          "end": 49.413,
          "en": "to this custom hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.25,
          "end": 55.11,
          "en": "And just as before, this object should be created outside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.11,
          "end": 58.383,
          "en": "of the component function to avoid infinite loops.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 60.69,
          "end": 64.38,
          "en": "Now here, this config object needs the method property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 64.38,
          "end": 66.57,
          "en": "which should be set to post",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 66.57,
          "end": 69.33,
          "en": "and the headers property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 69.33,
          "end": 74.33,
          "en": "which should be set to content-type application/json",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 74.73,
          "end": 77.40299999999999,
          "en": "because we'll send some JSON data later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 78.45,
          "end": 81.57,
          "en": "But of course we can't yet set up the body",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 81.57,
          "end": 83.52,
          "en": "because we'll only have that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.52,
          "end": 85.383,
          "en": "once the form has been submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 86.58,
          "end": 89.67,
          "en": "So we'll tweak the hook to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 89.67,
          "end": 92.31,
          "en": "that we can still use it in a couple of minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 92.31,
          "end": 94.773,
          "en": "And for now, I'll just set up this config.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 95.97,
          "end": 98.354,
          "en": "And it's now this request config that's passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 98.354,
          "end": 100.68,
          "en": "to the custom hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 100.68,
          "end": 105.18,
          "en": "And since this config object has the method set to post",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 105.18,
          "end": 106.89,
          "en": "inside of the custom hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.89,
          "end": 109.833,
          "en": "we also won't send a request right away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.7,
          "end": 112.74000000000001,
          "en": "Because here, we're only doing this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.74000000000001,
          "end": 115.443,
          "en": "if the config method is set to get,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.88,
          "end": 119.061,
          "en": "which is not the case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.061,
          "end": 122.4,
          "en": "Therefore, no request will be sent initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.4,
          "end": 124.53,
          "en": "and we can extract some data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.53,
          "end": 127.383,
          "en": "from the object we get back from the custom hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 128.55,
          "end": 130.89,
          "en": "We can get the data, state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.89,
          "end": 133.56,
          "en": "the isLoading state and the error state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.56,
          "end": 136.02,
          "en": "And very important for this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.02,
          "end": 138.123,
          "en": "the sendRequest function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.2,
          "end": 142.44,
          "en": "Because we need to send the request manually here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.44,
          "end": 143.523,
          "en": "in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.517,
          "end": 147.66,
          "en": "So the offer now, it's in handle submit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.66,
          "end": 150.879,
          "en": "where I want to call sendRequest",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.879,
          "end": 155.879,
          "en": "which I got from my custom hook to send that request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.24,
          "end": 161.04,
          "en": "But now I of course also wanna pass my data to sendRequest",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.04,
          "end": 163.893,
          "en": "and make sure that this data is being sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 164.82,
          "end": 166.41,
          "en": "And therefore we need to go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 166.41,
          "end": 169.53300000000002,
          "en": "to the custom hook and make it even more flexible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.4,
          "end": 174.06,
          "en": "Here, sendRequest should also accept the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 174.06,
          "end": 178.44,
          "en": "that should eventually be sent if any data is needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.44,
          "end": 181.03,
          "en": "And it should merge this into this config",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 182.25,
          "end": 184.59,
          "en": "so that we create a new object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 184.59,
          "end": 187.84,
          "en": "where we spread all the existing config options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.79,
          "end": 191.34,
          "en": "but where we then also set the body",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.34,
          "end": 193.233,
          "en": "to the data we're receiving here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.97,
          "end": 197.851,
          "en": "And therefore now with this adjustment made here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.851,
          "end": 201.45,
          "en": "sendRequest can now be used such that the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 201.45,
          "end": 204.15,
          "en": "is only passed at the point of time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.15,
          "end": 207.21,
          "en": "where we're ready to send the request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 207.21,
          "end": 211.113,
          "en": "whereas the other request config is made in advance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 212.82,
          "end": 215.25,
          "en": "Now since the data passed to send request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 215.25,
          "end": 217.68,
          "en": "is set as data for the body,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 217.68,
          "end": 221.07,
          "en": "and I'm sending some JSON data here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 221.07,
          "end": 224.43,
          "en": "in this request, we of course should make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 224.43,
          "end": 227.493,
          "en": "that we're passing JSON data to send request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 228.51,
          "end": 232.05,
          "en": "So we should actually take this entire value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 232.05,
          "end": 236.763,
          "en": "the JSON value as an input for send request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 237.87,
          "end": 241.32,
          "en": "And this now replaces this code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 241.32,
          "end": 243.573,
          "en": "hence making this component leaner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 244.65,
          "end": 247.713,
          "en": "And we can now also handle the different states.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 248.79,
          "end": 253.74,
          "en": "For example, there isLoading state when we are loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 253.74,
          "end": 256.38,
          "en": "so when we are sending the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 256.38,
          "end": 258.78,
          "en": "and therefore, we could of course alias this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 258.78,
          "end": 260.58,
          "en": "to make this even clearer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 260.58,
          "end": 262.08,
          "en": "When that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 262.08,
          "end": 266.58,
          "en": "I don't wanna show these buttons here for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 266.58,
          "end": 269.46,
          "en": "But instead I wanna show some text that informs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 269.46,
          "end": 272.673,
          "en": "the user that the request is currently on its way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 273.81,
          "end": 276.55899999999997,
          "en": "So I wanna output these buttons conditionally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 276.55899999999997,
          "end": 279.54,
          "en": "which we can do by adding a new variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 279.54,
          "end": 281.88,
          "en": "which could be called actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 281.88,
          "end": 286.88,
          "en": "And here, the default content could be these two buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 288.18,
          "end": 291.06,
          "en": "So I'll grab them, cut them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 291.06,
          "end": 293.913,
          "en": "and add them here wrapped by a fragment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 296.37,
          "end": 299.56,
          "en": "But I then check if isSending is true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 300.45,
          "end": 304.75,
          "en": "and if that's the case, actions could instead be a span",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 306.09,
          "end": 309.043,
          "en": "which says \"Sending Order Data...\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 312.21,
          "end": 315.78,
          "en": "And it's now this actions variable that's output down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 315.78,
          "end": 318.213,
          "en": "in this modal actions paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 321.78,
          "end": 323.97,
          "en": "With that, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 323.97,
          "end": 326.1,
          "en": "and we add a couple of items to the cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 326.1,
          "end": 328.32,
          "en": "and go to the checkout page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 328.32,
          "end": 331.473,
          "en": "if I enter some data here again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 339,
          "end": 344,
          "en": "like this and I open my network tools and throttle this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 344.49,
          "end": 347.28,
          "en": "so that the request will take a bit longer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 347.28,
          "end": 349.08,
          "en": "and I click Submit Order,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 349.08,
          "end": 351.153,
          "en": "I'm seeing \"Sending Order Data...\" here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 352.32,
          "end": 354.3,
          "en": "And then once the order was sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 354.3,
          "end": 357.33299999999997,
          "en": "and we're not sending anymore, I see the buttons again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 358.8,
          "end": 361.65,
          "en": "Now of course besides handling the loading state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 361.65,
          "end": 366.18,
          "en": "or sending state here, I also wanna handle the error state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 366.18,
          "end": 369.09,
          "en": "And for example, output an error message here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 369.09,
          "end": 372.243,
          "en": "above these buttons if something goes wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 373.11,
          "end": 375.15,
          "en": "We can check if error is true here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 375.15,
          "end": 379.74,
          "en": "and in that case, output the error component which we built",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 379.74,
          "end": 384.15,
          "en": "with a title of \"Failed to submit order.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 384.15,
          "end": 387.935,
          "en": "And then the message set equal to the error state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 387.935,
          "end": 389.35,
          "en": "Something like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 390.93,
          "end": 395.05,
          "en": "So that if something does go wrong, we do show this error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 396.51,
          "end": 398.64,
          "en": "And here to test this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 398.64,
          "end": 402.003,
          "en": "I'll temporarily tweak this URL again and break it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 404.31,
          "end": 406.68,
          "en": "With that if I save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 406.68,
          "end": 410.133,
          "en": "and I again enter some data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 411.18,
          "end": 412.863,
          "en": "just some dummy data for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 413.76,
          "end": 415.83,
          "en": "And I throttle this and submit the order,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 415.83,
          "end": 419.94,
          "en": "we got the loading state and then since it fails, the error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 419.94,
          "end": 421.563,
          "en": "So that also works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 423.48,
          "end": 424.313,
          "en": "Now with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 424.313,
          "end": 426.96,
          "en": "I'll go back to the valid URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 426.96,
          "end": 429.75,
          "en": "And last but not least, I wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 429.75,
          "end": 434.58,
          "en": "that we also show a success message if everything works out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 434.58,
          "end": 437.76,
          "en": "So in this checkout component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 437.76,
          "end": 442.29,
          "en": "maybe write down here, we can also check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 442.29,
          "end": 446.88,
          "en": "if we got data, which means we got back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 446.88,
          "end": 449.37,
          "en": "a valid response and no error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 449.37,
          "end": 452.703,
          "en": "So if we got data and no error, if that's the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 454.17,
          "end": 458.76,
          "en": "And in that case, I also wanna return a modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 458.76,
          "end": 460.713,
          "en": "but it will be a different modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 461.7,
          "end": 464.43,
          "en": "It will be a modal that should be open",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 464.43,
          "end": 467.343,
          "en": "if the progress is checkout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 468.48,
          "end": 472.05,
          "en": "And on close, I also wanna trigger handle close.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 472.05,
          "end": 473.32,
          "en": "This doesn't change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
